## Interface: 16001
## Title: ForeverGuide
## Notes: Free, data-driven leveling guide engine for WoW Forever. Reads game state and shows you the next step. Never automates anything.
## Author: Ilya
## Version: 0.2.0
## SavedVariables: ForeverGuideDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ForeverGuideCharDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Map_01
## X-Category: Quests & Leveling
## X-Flavor: Camelot (WoW Forever 1.60.x, Retail 12.x engine)

# ---- engine (load order matters) ----
Core.lua
Database.lua
Events.lua

# ---- quest database (generated by tools\build_questdb.lua from Questie's Classic data) ----
Data\ZoneDB.lua
Data\QuestDB.lua
Data\NpcDB.lua
Data\ObjectDB.lua
Data\ItemDB.lua
# ---- WoW Forever additions (generated by tools\merge_recorded.py / tools\import_db2.py) ----
Data\ForeverDB.lua
DB.lua

Player.lua
Quest.lua
Navigation.lua
Guide.lua
Tracker.lua
Recorder.lua
Data\VanillaQuestIDs.lua
Scanner.lua
Harvest.lua
UI.lua
Arrow.lua
AutoQuest.lua
Minimap.lua
Options.lua
Keybinds.lua
Commands.lua

# ---- guide data (generated by tools\compile_guides.py from guides-src\*.json) ----
Guides\Guides.xml

# ---- boot last, after all guides are registered ----
Init.lua
